{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1729.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"2605ad2e79bd46af488678da09bb77c63059014e2987032b319e6338e65fc410","ja":"よし、着替え終わり！\nそれじゃあ、私は先に帰るね！","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1729.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"26402950a270d15170a8e7862322bb7ae3ca8a04f4502b9b8f547285d5f03d05","ja":"ええっ！？　もう着替えちゃったんですか！？\n美奈子ちゃん、お早いですね！","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1729.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"9c4f0fee9387715b97cebeda02c09175799a3b95ed9434b45675cfaa8f5897c2","ja":"とてもお急ぎのようですが、\n何かご用事があるのでしょうか？","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1729.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"e7c750324aba4ef4856b0bc394ace3cc8995c47e1be7e2226d2cd4cfff04eab6","ja":"この後、お店を手伝わなきゃいけないんだ。\n最近また、すごく混むようになって。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1729.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"3805409f13762cd4eb27eb754c9a7011beaf53b3fe75de9d3e3aadbf769b27c5","ja":"この間は、確かお店の近くで工事があったから……\nだったよね？","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1729.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"5ff0c48c12a7e35d4ff8e1203b95ac5fc6e5cbe079c0fba06c717b1821308da9","ja":"うん。でも工事はもう終わってるんだけどね。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1729.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"1f1782ef61778651ed1f44133c58ef1361d78a33d3ca3050a8ba2512a5629e4e","ja":"そうなんだ？　あ、SNSでお店がバズって、\nそれで来てくれたのかも！","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1729.unity3d","item_key":"commands[37].text","source_sha256":"8d844b245179762c9ffd4d209476238ccd3a1e3e6cb71d9a46ba2c80afe6cdfd","ja":"うーん……今『佐竹飯店』で検索してみましたけど、\nそういうわけではなさそうですね……。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1729.unity3d","item_key":"commands[38].text","source_sha256":"b1608f3b6ac09058fca7a4957765967f3951ffcfd685291283bd001e8219a2d2","ja":"では、最近ご近所で評判になって……。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
